  "notes": "# DevClash 0.1.0-beta.8\n\nAutomatically detect Claude and Codex usage from Synara accounts on macOS, Windows and Linux.\n\n- Discover Synara account homes and configured provider paths automatically.\n- Avoid counting the same usage twice when logs are linked, copied, archived or discovered through more than one account path.\n- Keep a consistent gap between the rank card and Providers.\n- Preserve the existing sign-in session, display preferences and cloud-sync consent during updates. Expired or revoked sessions still require sign-in.\n- Carry forward the update-notice overlap fix and browser-based connection flow.\n\nThis remains a beta. Signed installers and the matching reviewed desktop source are published together.\n\nBuilt locally on native hosts. Source commit: eaa7d9cc3d7a0d8acd33b6b33c4b2bf2c1f84fd8.\n",
